  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I manage most of the organizing for my workout group, and we have sessions at specific times every week.\n\nSince there is currently no way to just create a reoccurring event in one swoop, I have to create the next events in advance. I can't even fix my mistake if an event I forgot to add is later the same day because I'm not allowed to create an event earlier than tomorrow.\n\nI also cannot create too many events in advance because eventually I get rate-limited.\n\nThis would all be considerably easier for everyone if I could just create a repeating event once for each session we work out in a week, aka just create 3 events in our case, and be done with it basically forever unless we change schedule.",
